---
layout: layouts/base.njk
---
{#-
  Start here (/start/): SPEC §7.3, §9.1-§9.3, §12, §15.1, §20 M1b;
  HANDOFF §6.2; board Intro-B.dc.html. There is no phone board, so phones
  follow the problem page's (Problem-Phone.dc.html; HANDOFF §11): full-bleed
  videos and a full-width end-card button.

  Only content/start.md uses it, and that file is data only: its body is not
  shown. The title band (with the chapter pills inside it), then TopicNav
  beside the content, all inside <main> so the skip link lands on the H1.
  The band uses the title-band classes from site.css; it is written out here
  because partials/title-band.njk has no place for the pills.

  Front matter read here (plus everything base.njk reads):
    eyebrow, heading, summary  the title band ("Start here", the H1, the lede)
    chapters                   [{ video, description }] (SPEC §7.3): one
                               chapter per intro video, #v1, #v2, ..., with
                               the title, duration and formats from the video
                               file (introChapters filter)

  Each chapter: a large faint number, "Video n of N · duration", the title
  (H2) and description, the video facade with its YouTube notice
  (partials/video.njk), then the row of controls under every video
  (partials/video-controls.njk): "Audio only", the handout and, while
  site.features.ratings is exactly true, "Was this helpful?" with its stars
  (SPEC §12). As on problem pages, it is a plain row, not the board's white
  bar (SPEC §7.5). It is left out when it would be empty; holding only the
  rating, it ships hidden for rating.js to reveal. No transcripts (SPEC
  §9.3) and no per-video feedback (SPEC §7.5, §13). Then the end card to the
  Sleep problems page.
-#}
{%- from "partials/topic-nav.njk" import topicNav -%}
{%- from "partials/video.njk" import videoEmbed -%}
{%- from "notices/video.njk" import youtubeNote -%}
{%- from "partials/video-controls.njk" import videoControls -%}
{%- set topicAreas = collections.problems | groupByArea(areas) -%}
{%- set introVideos = chapters | introChapters(collections.videos) -%}
{%- set chapterCount = introVideos | length -%}
<main id="main">
  <div class="band on-dark start-band">
    <div class="band__inner container">
      <p class="band__eyebrow">{{ eyebrow }}</p>
      <h1 class="band__title">{{ heading or title }}</h1>
      <p class="band__lede start-band__lede">{{ summary }}</p>
      {#- Jump links to the chapters. The first is filled as static emphasis
          ("start with this one"), not as a you-are-here marker. #}
      <nav class="chapter-pills" aria-label="On this page">
        <ol class="chapter-pills__list" role="list">
          {%- for chapter in introVideos %}
          <li><a class="chapter-pill{% if loop.first %} chapter-pill--lead{% endif %}" href="#{{ chapter.id }}"><span class="chapter-pill__num">{{ chapter.n }}<span class="visually-hidden">.</span></span> {{ chapter.title }}</a></li>
          {%- endfor %}
        </ol>
      </nav>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="with-sidebar with-sidebar--roomy container start-layout">
    <div class="with-sidebar__side">
      {{ topicNav(topicAreas, page_id, area, introVideos, 's-', page.url) }}
    </div>
    <div class="with-sidebar__main start-flow">
      {%- for chapter in introVideos %}
      {%- set video = chapter.video %}
      {%- set spoken = video.duration | spokenDuration %}
      <article class="start-chapter" id="{{ chapter.id }}" aria-labelledby="{{ chapter.id }}-title">
        <div class="start-chapter__head">
          <span class="start-chapter__num" aria-hidden="true">{{ chapter.n }}</span>
          <div class="start-chapter__heading">
            <p class="eyebrow start-chapter__eyebrow">Video {{ chapter.n }} of {{ chapterCount }}<span aria-hidden="true"> · {{ video.duration }}</span><span class="visually-hidden">, {{ spoken or video.duration }}</span></p>
            <h2 class="section-heading start-chapter__title" id="{{ chapter.id }}-title">{{ chapter.title }}</h2>
            <p class="start-chapter__desc">{{ chapter.description }}</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        {{ videoEmbed(video, bleed='page', arc=true, size='lg') }}
        {{- videoControls(video, site.features.ratings === true) }}
      </article>
      {%- endfor %}
      <section class="start-next on-dark">
        <div class="start-next__text">
          <p class="eyebrow start-next__eyebrow">Next</p>
          <h2 class="section-heading start-next__title">Choose what's keeping you up</h2>
          <p class="start-next__body">{{ collections.problems | length }} sleep problems, grouped into {{ topicAreas | length | numberWord }} areas. Pick as many as sound like you.</p>
        </div>
        <a class="button button--light start-next__action" href="/problems/">See sleep problems</a>
      </section>
      {#- The page's YouTube note, once, last (SPEC §15.1). #}
      {{ youtubeNote() }}
    </div>
  </div>
</main>
